          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Per-shape knob values override instance-wide parameters and compiled defaults, and apply cluster-wide to the matching shape. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setQuerySettings.md",
